% =====================================================================
% MANUAL TEST SCENARIO T3 - "Emergency stop at the platform"
% =====================================================================
% Hand-written by the test engineer, NOT generated by the LLM.
% Pins only the INPUTS: the event, its cause and its location.
%   cause    = ObstacleDetected
%   location = WithinStoppingWindow (the train is at a platform)
%
% What the metamodel derives automatically:
%   * missingEmergencyBubble        -> EmergencyBubble on TMCPort, PICPort,
%                                      screenPort, WCU1Port and WCU2Port
%   * doorsNotReleasedForEvacuation -> emDoors must be DoorsOpen
%   * missingEvacuationBubble       -> EvacuationBubble on PICPort and screenPort
%   * regularBubbleDuringEmergency  -> no ArrivalEvent / DepartureEvent /
%                                      StandstillBubble object at all
% =====================================================================

EmergencyStop(em1).
trainEvent(t1, em1).

ObstacleDetected(cause1).
emCause(em1, cause1).

WithinStoppingWindow(window1).
emWindow(em1, window1).
